DataElement L2\ncache region lock. That lock is per region rather than per key, so every miss\nblocks readers of every other data element.\n\nOnly three call sites read that association during import and all need just an\nidentifier: the compulsory data elements (E1303, E1076), payload membership\n(E1305) and program rule effect membership. The latter two are membership tests\nwhose probes are known up front, so a data element neither the payload nor the\nrules mention cannot change the outcome.\n\nDrop the mapping and project the needed identifiers with one JDBC query per\npreheat, bypassing Hibernate and so the L2 cache. Bounded by the compulsory\ncount plus payload and rule width rather than by program width.\n\nThe rule engine runs after validation and DataValuesValidator runs again\nafterwards, on the payload an ASSIGN effect mutated, so the projection must\ncover data elements the original payload never carried. It does, because\nTrackerIdentifierCollector preheats the data elements of all program rule\nactions. Tests pin that invariant.","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"de1dd1a1c9b27ba256387a4e65cba80bbcd24f26","tree_id":"98641695d42382ba2a9d65d2bec85ca6f233c99c","timestamp":"2026-08-17T08:37:56Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","g